[I] A cross-desktop display manager

[T] LightDM is a cross-desktop display manager. It was built as a relatively
[T] light-weight and highly customizable alternative to GDM

[U] https://github.com/canonical/lightdm

[A] Canonical
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/multimedia
[F] CROSS NO-LTO.clang

[L] GPL
[V] 1.33.1
[P] X -----5---9 153.000

[D] 5398ad5d9c9dcfacacb8cc91cefa43e1cecb247c9e91aae58d2214d1 lightdm-1.33.1.tar.gz https://github.com/ubuntu/lightdm/archive/1.33.1/

autogen=1

var_append GCC_WRAPPER_INSERT ' ' "-I$root$(pkgprefix includedir libx11)"
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_INSERT ' ' "-L$root$(pkgprefix libdir libx11)"
pkginstalled gobject-introspection && var_append confopt ' ' --disable-introspection
